            "review_title": "Review at Wrap & Roll Vincom Đồng Khởi, Q.1",
            "review_text": "Flora\nSydney, Australia5 contributions\n0\nDisappointed experience.\nJan 2020\nIt’s a franchise and inside the Vincom centre. We thought it shouldn’t be too bad. But the rice papers of the rolls we ordered were way too dry. We had to ask them to remade it and unfortunately it was not much better. And the drink took forever to come. We ordered the drink at the beginning of our meal and asked for it twice during our meal but was served almost 10 mins after we finished our meal. Disappointed experience.\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
