            "review_text": "SwissGourmet@Taiwan\nBeitun, Taichung2306 contributions\n0\nGreat choice for street food with AC!\nOct 2019 • Friends\nThe Lettuce and Prawn Rolls\n were fresh and delicious, the Beef Pho good enough, and the rice noodles topped with ground pork and mushrooms as well as the Green Mango Salad were totally scrumptious. It's simple food nicely done, the prices are similar to street stalls, and the staff tries hard. If you have a problem or question just ask for an English speaking server, they are eager to help.\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2019",
