            "review_text": "Vincent Chan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nNever come back\nNov 2017 • Friends\nStaff unfriendly, When we came here for lunch, I asked the staff about open hours but they did not care about us. Very terrible !!!\nWritten November 14, 2017\nWrapRollVN\nFirst of all, thank you for your honest feedback when you were at our restaurant. \nWe sincerely apologize that you had an unpleasant experience with our service staff. We had a meeting with the staffs to improve our operation flow to prevent from a future issue like this. \nWe want to apologize to you. We will try our best to improve the situation for sure to keep good quality. We would like to see you again at our restaurant and would like you to see our improvement in the future.\nThank you very much for your feedback.\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
