            "review_text": "Tam D\n9 contributions\n0\nThe worst experience\nNov 2017 • Family\nMy sister and I had lunch there. The restaurant was over crowded. My sister’s rice noodle soup had spoiled ham. Then came the beef wrapped in betel leaves. It was rotten, tasted and smelt real bad. \nWe will never come back here again.\nTerrible!!\nWritten November 13, 2017\nWrapRollVN\nThank you very much for dining at Wrap & Roll and giving us your honest feedback. \nWe sincerely apologize that our food quality your previous visit. All of these mistakes are lacking of our ability. We appreciate your information and it will be very helpful to improve our food and service quality. \nAgain, we sincerely apologize that multiple mistakes caused you a great trouble. We take your feedback very seriously and try to improve our service. And we will try our best not to repeat such an incident.\nAgain, we apologize for our food.\nThank you\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
