            "review_text": "williefil13\nSingapore, Singapore1227 contributions\n0\nLocal chainfood restaurant\nAug 2017 • Family\nThe restaurant is in a nice environment/mall. The staff is very attentive and the food is reasonable. The price is reasonable also, pho at 60k dong. The menu has many options also, I recommend if you are looking for a cheap price local food.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 5, 2017\nWrapRollVN\nThank you for your time and sweet review for Wrap & Roll. \nWe are very grateful to have received such a thoughtful review. Besides, we are very glad to hear that you enjoyed your meal at Wrap & Roll. Wrap & Roll always tries our best to bring customers the best experience dining at the restaurant. We are looking forward to seeing you again. Please come again and try more dishes at our restaurant. \nThank you so much.\nBest regards.\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
