            "review_text": "Susan H\nWhangarei58 contributions\n0\nNice Lunch\nJul 2017 • Family\nWe decided to give wrap & roll a go while we were out wanting something easy for lunch. The prices were reasonable, the service was good & we enjoyed the food. We had the fresh spring rolls, green papaya salad & beef shin. It was all good and nice & quick & easy while we were out shopping. It was very busy and could get quite noisy however it is part of a big food centre and you have to expect that. We would visit again for a quick lunch which is value for money.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 12, 2017\nWrapRollVN\nThank you for your time and sweet review for Wrap & Roll. \nWe are very grateful to have received such a thoughtful review. Besides, we are very glad to hear that you enjoyed your meal at Wrap & Roll. Wrap & Roll always tries our best to bring customers the best experience dining at the restaurant. We are looking forward to seeing you again. Please come again and try more dishes at our restaurant. \nThank you so much.\nBest regards.\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
